  "description": "Operating Area: Adriatic Sea, Croatia, Montenegro\n\nM/Y Ferretti 780 \"ORLANDO L\" offers luxurious accommodation for eight guests across four elegantly appointed staterooms, including a full-beam Owner’s suite.\nHer contemporary interior design creates a spacious and inviting atmosphere, while the expansive, sheltered aft deck provides the perfect setting for relaxation.\n\nEquipped with a variety of water toys and generous sunbathing areas, ORLANDO L is the ideal yacht for exploring the Adriatic, whether you're cruising with friends or enjoying quality time with family, all while soaking in the breathtaking surroundings.",
